gametitle=Beat Down - Fists of Vengeance (USA) [SLUS-21150]

[Aaron uses Raven's moveset]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=Points Aaron's character class (row 33 of the class table at 0x0050D6A0) at Raven's fighting style 0x11 and Raven's animation groups. Aaron keeps his own model.
patch=1,EE,2050D8B4,extended,00000011
patch=1,EE,2050D8BC,extended,0050D150

[Aaron uses Jason G's moveset]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=Aaron fights with Jason G's style 0x12. Aaron is medium and Jason G is large, so Aaron keeps his medium body animations: his own group list at 0x0050D100 gets Jason G's move group 183 in place of 184, plus Jason G's group 209. Turn on only one Aaron cheat at a time, and restart the game after switching.
patch=1,EE,2050D8B4,extended,00000012
patch=1,EE,2050D8BC,extended,0050D100
patch=1,EE,2050D13C,extended,000000B7
patch=1,EE,2050D144,extended,000000D1
patch=1,EE,2050D148,extended,0000270F

[Aaron uses Ignacy's moveset and Chester's model]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=Aaron fights with Ignacy's style 0x0C and Ignacy's animation groups (all medium bodies, so a plain swap). For the model, a small hook at 0x003E0130 makes fighter init (0x0013B54C and 0x0013B55C) load Chester's outfit preset 23 whenever it builds Aaron (presets 78, 79, 153). Aaron keeps his own preset number, so the game still recognises him as Aaron (HP bar name). Turn on only one Aaron cheat at a time, and restart the game after switching.
patch=1,EE,2050D8B4,extended,0000000C
patch=1,EE,2050D8BC,extended,0050D290
